  "_notes": [
    "UNQUALIFIED EXAMPLE. No PoPL deployment, approved authority wallets, live price feeds, complete read-only observations or independent production evidence is supplied. Public signing and deployment are not authorized.",
    "Only known source-selected Robinhood native venue/token identities and hard pins are populated. They are intended references, not fresh on-chain observations or a service qualification. Observed fields and review evidence stay unset.",
    "Schema 5 is the explicit native/accounting-V2/routing-V2/pricing-V2/review-policy-V1 governed profile. The preserved schema-4 example remains historical and blocked for this layout; never relabel WETH ledgers or existing journals as native V2. Current Entry requires executeReviewed with a caller maximum; legacy execute fails closed.",
    "Pricing version 2 requires two independently reviewed USD sources PER asset, immutable source-runtime pins, full append-only policy and fresh agreed rounds. Two addresses, the target pool spot, a presumed stable peg or correlated test mirrors do not qualify independence. The user-selected disagreement tolerance is 300 bps (3%); source addresses and freshness limits are deliberately unset; no live ZZZ pair of sources is supplied.",
    "A 3% agreement tolerance does not raise the separate default 2% contribution and 1% conversion loss caps. Upper-input/lower-output conservative valuation can reject an operation within 3% agreement; there is no averaging, one-source fallback or automatic cap increase.",
    "One ETH/ZZZ contribution pool at a time. The selected static hookless pool is 0x501122bfd256e408a63bddad901cc19a2512d74b2006f0474a3cf480e94afe1b, fee 10020 pips, spacing 200. Actual fees/state/liquidity must be read and independently qualified.",
    "Current policy defaults shown are contribution 2%, LP/royalty conversion 1%, maintenance 3%, each governance-configurable up to 10%. Observe and review actual values; do not assume defaults or raise caps automatically. Gas is separate.",
    "A cheaper independently qualified ZZZ-to-ETH route is still required at the default 1% limit. Empty conversion routes, missing source policies or unknown prices block this example. Activation and LP growth accept only native ETH or the reviewed current ZZZ. Marketplace royalty currencies and their separate conversions do not add user contribution inputs.",
    "Current fee_intake_version 1 uses the LP-only controller and 15 current helpers (including ActivationAssetsFactory, with no RewardReceiverFactory) and the Native LP-only V3 canonical schema. Creator-payment inboxes and remote-fee intake are removed. Absent/zero is a historical 15-helper Native V2 layout only; never reinterpret its snapshots. Cross-chain canonical import and legacy V1 ledgers remain unsupported.",
    "Production minting is intended for OpenSea but chain/product/recipient/VRF compatibility is unqualified. ERC-2981 requests 5%; only royalties actually received can be distributed.",
    "Publish and review the complete 2784-asset content-addressed artwork root. No new artwork generation is implied. Exact quota draw uses verified randomness; live coordinator/subscription/provider qualification remains open.",
    "Keep credentials and private material outside this inventory. The observer performs only bounded read-only RPC calls and does not set approved pins or evidence. Offline ready means declared inventory consistency only and never authorizes deployment, sealing or spending.",
    "Range-policy version 1 is explicit for this candidate. Set Strategy setRangeOrientation(pool,1) for ZZZ priced in ETH. Adaptive selection is disabled until reviewed drift thresholds, cooldown and policy hash are approved; observing a new runtime is not approval. Historical profiles retain their original raw-ratio semantics."
  ],
